    "content": "<p>Use your wits and wiles to seize the upper hand in the Tricksters Update, a new content update coming to War Robots: Frontiers on January 31.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the latest Dev Diary from Zukata, the Creative Director of War Robots: Frontiers, get a first look at the main features of the update. Prepare to battle on a new map, expand your squad with the Robots Raven and Loki, and power up with three new weapons and special abilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B9UobjkOWIM\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/B9UobjkOWIM?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=LBSqV\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube channel</a> and stay tuned for more War Robots: Frontiers videos!</p>",
